  epo:specifiesProcurementCriterion <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/8c72b749-0c8b-48ef-9815-1c1747039873-01/ParticipationCondition$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_TendererQualificationRequest2>,
    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/8c72b749-0c8b-48ef-9815-1c1747039873-01/SelectionCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria1>,
